{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">港股連升兩日後有回吐。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">科網股拖低大市，阿里巴巴曾急挫半成，下試102元水平，騰訊也跌近百分之2。人工智能大模型股份受壓，MINIMAX跌逾百分之5。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-07T05:59:19.077922+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":75,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}